{'symbol': 'VICI', 'date': '2021-10-05 18:20:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION OF VICI PROPERTIES, INC. - VICI', 'text': 'NEW YORK, OCT. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 JUAN MONTEVERDE , FOUNDER AND MANAGING PARTNER AT MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC, A NATIONAL SECURITIES FIRM RATED\xa0TOP 50\xa0IN THE 2018-2020 ISS SECURITIES CLASS ACTION SERVICES REPORT AND HEADQUARTERED AT THE\xa0EMPIRE STATE BUILDING\xa0IN NEW YORK CITY, IS INVESTIGATING\xa0VICI PROPERTIES, INC. ("VICI" OR THE "COMPANY") (VICI)\xa0RELATING TO ITS PROPOSED MERGER WITH MGM GROWTH PROPERTIES LLC (MGP). UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, MGP SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE 1.366 SHARES OF VICI PER SHARE THEY OWN.'}